## What it is

Frosted-glass vertical **list card** with soft lavender atmosphere. Rows = floating circular icon disc + short text stack + thin progress/separator. Canvas presentation uses **3D perspective tilt** (floating slab).

Do **not** copy DesignCode course copy, Swift/React/Flutter logos, or lavender marketing chrome as BMClinic brand. Reuse **structure + depth + glass list grammar**.

## Structure

```
List (glass plate)
 ├── Row × N
 │    ├── Play / icon disc (~52px, soft shadow, optional gradient ring)
 │    └── Text
 │         ├── category (UPPERCASE, small)
 │         ├── title
 │         ├── short body
 │         └── Progress (thin track)
 └── hairline separators between rows
```

| Token | Source value (adapt) |
|-------|----------------------|
| Plate fill | `rgba(255,255,255,0.4)` + `backdrop-filter: blur(20px)` |
| Radius / padding / gap | ~25px / ~17px / ~13px |
| Icon disc | ~52px circle, multi-layer soft shadow, elevated Z |
| Category | ~11px semibold, uppercase, opacity ~0.7 |
| Title | ~14px semibold, opacity ~0.6 |
| Body | ~10px regular |
| Separator | ~1px `rgba(0,0,0,0.4)` (+ overlay blend in source) |
| Progress | ~111×3px track; white fill segment |
| Source accents | lavender atmosphere; `#00CFFD`; black labels |

## 3D perspective cues

- Parent `perspective`; plate `transform: rotateX() rotateY()` (slight Z if needed) for diagonal recede
- Soft diffuse shadows for elevation; discs above text/plate
- Keep icon discs **square** — never stretch

## BMClinic / CML reuse

1. Keep grammar: glass plate → stacked rows → floating icon + short hierarchy + hairlines.
2. Remap materials to locked brand: black / `#1D1B16`, gold `#C4A874`, **transparent dark glass** (radial wash + light border + blur) — see `cml-surgeon-direction` / `cml-objawy-glass-system`. Translate frosted white → dark glass; do not invent milky cards over living-wall.
3. Prefer images/frames over long copy.
4. **Brand caveat:** CML hero photo rules stay locked (full-bleed gabinet, yellow waterfall, green tree left, no hue-rotate, text in thumb zone). Use this language for lists, boards, secondary/promo plates — **not** to rewrite the locked hero.
